      "reasoning_content": "Good, the git setup is clean. Now I'll create the article. This is going to be a substantial HTML file, so let me compose it carefully following the template structure.\n\nKey facts about Labrador Retrievers I'll incorporate:\n- Origin: Newfoundland, Canada (not Labrador as the name suggests)\n- Bred by 2nd Earl of Malmesbury and Duke of Buccleuch\n- Originally fishing dogs, then hunting/retrieving\n- Recognized by Kennel Club in 1903\n- 3 colors: black, yellow, chocolate\n- Height: 54-57cm (female), 56-62cm (male)\n- Weight: 25-36kg\n- Lifespan: 10-12 years\n- Temperament: friendly, active, outgoing\n- Prone to: hip/elbow dysplasia, obesity, ear infections, PRA\n- Known for being great family dogs, therapy dogs, service dogs\n\nLet me now write the full article.",
